    "name": "Among Us 3D: VR",
    "steam_appid": 1849900,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Among Us 3D: VR\u00a0</i>is a party game of teamwork and betrayal. Grab your crew of 4-10 players and launch into a fully 3D version of the beloved social deduction game. Work together as Crewmates to complete tasks before one or more Impostors kill everyone aboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Note:</strong> <i>Among Us 3D: VR\u00a0</i>is NOT compatible and does not feature crossplay with the original <i>Among Us</i> game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849900/extras/a69919dd5f7dbe19c1e43abceb1618b3.poster.avif?t=1753981173\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849900/extras/a69919dd5f7dbe19c1e43abceb1618b3.webm?t=1753981173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849900/extras/a69919dd5f7dbe19c1e43abceb1618b3.mp4?t=1753981173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the core <i>Among Us</i> gameplay you know and love, such as tasks, sabotages, Emergency Meetings, and venting \u2014 now in 3D!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as either Crewmate or Impostor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014 <strong>Crewmate Mission</strong>: Complete all the tasks or eject the Impostor. Keep your eyes and ears open - someone could be lurking right around the corner.<br>\u2014 <strong>Impostor Mission</strong>: Sabotage and kill the Crewmates! Frame the crew, sneak through the vents, and craft the perfect lie.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849900/extras/3a69d1d20460ca8063fc48f3d5a9c91a.poster.avif?t=1753981173\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849900/extras/3a69d1d20460ca8063fc48f3d5a9c91a.webm?t=1753981173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849900/extras/3a69d1d20460ca8063fc48f3d5a9c91a.mp4?t=1753981173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Switch things up with Tag Mode and regular Limited Time Events!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Introducing <strong>The Infected</strong>! In Tag Mode, it\u2019s Infected versus Crewmates. <strong>The Infected </strong>try to catch and infect all the Crewmates to expand their ranks before the Crewmates can finish a set number of tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Limited Time Events</strong> change the experience even more. From experimental gameplay, to unique cosmetic styles, regular <strong>Limited Time Events</strong> bring something new and exciting throughout the year!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849900/extras/73821d9a98717cff5fccdaf3ffaef42f.poster.avif?t=1753981173\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849900/extras/73821d9a98717cff5fccdaf3ffaef42f.webm?t=1753981173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849900/extras/73821d9a98717cff5fccdaf3ffaef42f.mp4?t=1753981173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy returning crew favorite tasks, reimagined with innovative and immersive first-person controls. Beware the Impostor while you try your hand at all new tasks, too! Customize your gameplay, comfort, and safety settings to build the best experience possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lobby up and connect with millions of other Crewmates \u2014 including <i>Among Us 3D</i> PC players! \u2014 with native crossplay. Create custom lobbies for you and your closest pals with unique and personalized settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Note:</strong> <i>Among Us 3D: VR\u00a0</i>is NOT compatible and does not feature crossplay with the original <i>Among Us</i> game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849900/extras/294e77bf09d586b52cb9757dcfe9ec7e.poster.avif?t=1753981173\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849900/extras/294e77bf09d586b52cb9757dcfe9ec7e.webm?t=1753981173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849900/extras/294e77bf09d586b52cb9757dcfe9ec7e.mp4?t=1753981173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fashion your Crewmate with an endless number of color, hat, glove, and skin combinations. Expand your wardrobe even more with Stardust. Purchase this in-game currency* to spend on additional cosmetics and let your true style shine!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Note</strong>: Stardust is not compatible with and cannot be converted to or from currencies in the original <i>Among Us</i> game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849900/extras/bcffa5f0ee76f05b245fe4e18a7d50d4.poster.avif?t=1753981173\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849900/extras/bcffa5f0ee76f05b245fe4e18a7d50d4.webm?t=1753981173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849900/extras/bcffa5f0ee76f05b245fe4e18a7d50d4.mp4?t=1753981173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Team up with or betray your friends using your preferred method of communication:<br>\u2014 Yap away with native, proximity voice chat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014 No more need for external apps for chatting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014 Not a talker? Use intuitive and efficient Quick Text Chat options to stay communicative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Among Us 3D: VR\u00a0</i>is a party game of teamwork and betrayal. Grab your crew of 4-10 players and launch into a fully 3D version of the beloved social deduction game. Work together as Crewmates to complete tasks before one or more Impostors kill everyone aboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Note:</strong> <i>Among Us 3D: VR\u00a0</i>is NOT compatible and does not feature crossplay with the original <i>Among Us</i> game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849900/extras/a69919dd5f7dbe19c1e43abceb1618b3.poster.avif?t=1753981173\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849900/extras/a69919dd5f7dbe19c1e43abceb1618b3.webm?t=1753981173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849900/extras/a69919dd5f7dbe19c1e43abceb1618b3.mp4?t=1753981173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the core <i>Among Us</i> gameplay you know and love, such as tasks, sabotages, Emergency Meetings, and venting \u2014 now in 3D!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as either Crewmate or Impostor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014 <strong>Crewmate Mission</strong>: Complete all the tasks or eject the Impostor. Keep your eyes and ears open - someone could be lurking right around the corner.<br>\u2014 <strong>Impostor Mission</strong>: Sabotage and kill the Crewmates! Frame the crew, sneak through the vents, and craft the perfect lie.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849900/extras/3a69d1d20460ca8063fc48f3d5a9c91a.poster.avif?t=1753981173\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849900/extras/3a69d1d20460ca8063fc48f3d5a9c91a.webm?t=1753981173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849900/extras/3a69d1d20460ca8063fc48f3d5a9c91a.mp4?t=1753981173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Switch things up with Tag Mode and regular Limited Time Events!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Introducing <strong>The Infected</strong>! In Tag Mode, it\u2019s Infected versus Crewmates. <strong>The Infected </strong>try to catch and infect all the Crewmates to expand their ranks before the Crewmates can finish a set number of tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Limited Time Events</strong> change the experience even more. From experimental gameplay, to unique cosmetic styles, regular <strong>Limited Time Events</strong> bring something new and exciting throughout the year!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849900/extras/73821d9a98717cff5fccdaf3ffaef42f.poster.avif?t=1753981173\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849900/extras/73821d9a98717cff5fccdaf3ffaef42f.webm?t=1753981173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849900/extras/73821d9a98717cff5fccdaf3ffaef42f.mp4?t=1753981173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy returning crew favorite tasks, reimagined with innovative and immersive first-person controls. Beware the Impostor while you try your hand at all new tasks, too! Customize your gameplay, comfort, and safety settings to build the best experience possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lobby up and connect with millions of other Crewmates \u2014 including <i>Among Us 3D</i> PC players! \u2014 with native crossplay. Create custom lobbies for you and your closest pals with unique and personalized settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Note:</strong> <i>Among Us 3D: VR\u00a0</i>is NOT compatible and does not feature crossplay with the original <i>Among Us</i> game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849900/extras/294e77bf09d586b52cb9757dcfe9ec7e.poster.avif?t=1753981173\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849900/extras/294e77bf09d586b52cb9757dcfe9ec7e.webm?t=1753981173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849900/extras/294e77bf09d586b52cb9757dcfe9ec7e.mp4?t=1753981173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fashion your Crewmate with an endless number of color, hat, glove, and skin combinations. Expand your wardrobe even more with Stardust. Purchase this in-game currency* to spend on additional cosmetics and let your true style shine!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Note</strong>: Stardust is not compatible with and cannot be converted to or from currencies in the original <i>Among Us</i> game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849900/extras/bcffa5f0ee76f05b245fe4e18a7d50d4.poster.avif?t=1753981173\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849900/extras/bcffa5f0ee76f05b245fe4e18a7d50d4.webm?t=1753981173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1849900/extras/bcffa5f0ee76f05b245fe4e18a7d50d4.mp4?t=1753981173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Team up with or betray your friends using your preferred method of communication:<br>\u2014 Yap away with native, proximity voice chat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014 No more need for external apps for chatting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014 Not a talker? Use intuitive and efficient Quick Text Chat options to stay communicative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "short_description": "Teamwork and betrayal in space! In this PC &amp; VR party game, Crewmates work together to complete tasks before one or more Impostors kill everyone aboard. Experience all of the same deception and deceit as the original Among Us, but now in all three dimensions.",
    "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Japanese, Korean, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese",
    "reviews": "\u201cThis is easily one of the best VR adaptations of an existing game yet.\u201d<br>9/10 \u2013 IGN<br><br>\u201cUndoubtedly, VR makes Among Us 10 times better than the original!\u201d<br>9.2/10 \u2013 Lords of Gaming<br><br>\u201cAmong Us [3D]: VR is a great execution of an extremely popular game - and genre - of recent years.\u201d<br>8.5/10 \u2013 Dual Shockers<br>",
